<title>USA: Racotek sets up Unisys mobile data system.</title>
<headline>Racotek sets up Unisys mobile data system.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, Minn. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Racotek Inc said Thursday it is completing efforts to establish a mobile data system for more than 2,000 Unisys Corp field employees.</p>
<p>More than half of the U.S. field service workers already have access to the system, said Racotek. The remainder will be operational in 1997.</p>
<p>The system is designed to improve communication with computer service technicians in the field and improve customer response times, said the company.</p>
<p>Racotek designs and implements mobile data systems in addition to providing consulting and professional services.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787)</p>
